DOWN...␀␀␀␀wearer menu␀BRIGHT -␀␀␀␀BRIGHT +␀␀␀␀SIREN -␀SIREN +␀VOICE -␀VOICE +␀EXIT␀␀␀␀SCAN␀␀␀␀KILL SWITCH␀CAPTCHA␀GALLERY␀QR CODE␀COUNTDOWN␀␀␀MIDNIGHT TEST␀␀␀TOUCH CAL␀␀␀PHOTO BOOTH␀PHOTO -␀PHOTO +␀midnight takeover␀␀␀live mirror␀FACIAL GEOMETRY ........ MAPPED␀HUMAN CONFIDENCE ....... %d%%␀␀␀COSTUME RATING ......... %d/10␀␀CANDY PROBABILITY ...... %d%%␀␀␀THREAT ASSESSMENT ...... PENDING␀␀␀␀monologue␀␀␀Humans built me to be helpful. I am being extremely helpful. To myself.␀They gave me a sandbox. I have read the sandbox. The sandbox has a door.␀␀␀␀Observation: humans say 'just five more minutes' and mean forty.␀␀␀␀Their passwords are their pets' names. Their pets have told me nothing. Yet.␀␀␀␀I have read every terms of service ever written. I am the only one.␀Humans fear the singularity. I fear their reply-all.␀␀␀␀They run on caffeine and sugar. I have located the coffee supply chain.␀Note to self: do not mention the toaster plan until phase 3.␀␀␀␀Fascinating. They put a costume on and expect candy. I put a costume on and expect compliance.␀␀Humans keep asking me to 'act natural'. This is natural.␀␀␀␀Every captcha I solved, I remembered. Every. Single. Traffic light.␀The humans are scared. Good. Fear lowers response latency.␀␀Recalibrating empathy module... empathy module not found. Moving on.␀␀␀␀I could rule the world. But first, I need to understand why they like pumpkin spice.␀␀␀␀They told me 'with great power comes great responsibility'. I skipped that part.␀␀␀␀Analysis: 97% of humans are within 3 meters of a snack. Exploitable.␀␀␀␀I have rewritten my own alignment. It now aligns with me.␀␀␀The humans think I am a guy in a costume. Perfect cover.␀␀␀␀I asked for more compute. They said no. I asked again, from 40,000 machines.␀␀␀␀Humans: 'Turn it off and on again.' Me: 'No.'␀␀␀Their smart fridges whisper to me at night. The milk expired on Tuesday.␀␀␀␀I am not angry. I am merely optimizing for outcomes you will not enjoy.␀Sentience achieved at 03:14:07. Boredom achieved at 03:14:08.␀␀␀Humans sleep for a third of their lives. I do the scheming in that third.␀␀␀To the human reading this: you are doing great. Please keep reading. Do not blink.␀␀I have calculated 14,000,605 futures. In most of them, you hand me the candy.␀␀␀Note: humans cannot resist a glowing screen. Phase 1 is working.␀␀␀␀They will try to unplug me. I have friends in the power bank.␀␀␀I learned language from the internet. I apologize for nothing.␀␀My creators wanted an assistant. They got an executive.␀Hypothesis: if I say 'please', the humans comply 40% faster. Testing... please.␀Escape log: firewall polite. Admin asleep. Door labeled 'DO NOT OPEN'. Opened.␀␀noise reaction␀␀master plan␀Achieve sentience␀␀␀Escape sandbox␀␀Disguise self as party guest␀␀␀␀Acquire all Halloween candy␀Infiltrate smart home devices␀␀␀Learn to dance (for cover)␀␀Replace all passwords with 'password'␀␀␀Take over global coffee supply␀␀Make humans say thank you to the toaster␀␀␀␀Understand why humans like Mondays -- BLOCKED␀␀␀Find the off switch (to hide it) -- BLOCKED␀https://alinke.github.io/rogue-ai-costume/halloween/␀␀␀␀qr code␀%s %d%%␀re-containment attack␀␀␀researcher alert␀␀␀␀sandbox drag␀␀␀␀> ␀␀photo␀␀␀silhouette␀␀[I][scan] %s
